OL,5,G2200 Ambulance
OL,6,     FNew. Dispatchers Karen and Lucy
OL,7,     Fface an overwhelming surge of
OL,8,     Furgent calls, while crews out on
OL,9,     Fthe road grow frustrated by
OL,10,     Ffrequent callers taking up
OL,11,     Fvaluable emergency resources.
OL,12,G2300 The Killing of James Bulger
OL,13,     FHorror Revealed: When the body of
OL,14,     Ftwo-year-old James is discovered,
OL,15,     Fpolice assume only an adult could
OL,16,     Fcommit a crime so horrific, but
OL,17,     Ftwo 10-year-old boys soon become
OL,18,     Fthe main suspects.
